WEBVTT

01:42.370 --> 01:45.040
GWARGH!

01:45.500 --> 01:45.960
YEEART!

01:49.980 --> 01:51.380
Finish him!

01:55.380 --> 01:57.720
Let me take over your body.

01:57.720 --> 02:00.140
I will give you power.

02:00.140 --> 02:01.890
Silence, NARAKU!

02:01.890 --> 02:07.190
Who do you think made it possible for you to win your last battle?

02:07.850 --> 02:11.480
I must settle things with this man

02:11.480 --> 02:13.020
with my own hands!

02:15.780 --> 02:17.070
YEEART!

02:26.040 --> 02:28.540
GWARGH!

02:28.540 --> 02:30.630
Farewell, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

02:40.260 --> 02:42.640
Their KARATE techniques were polar opposites.

02:42.880 --> 02:44.680
NINJA Slayer struck harder.

02:44.680 --> 02:46.850
Dark NINJA struck faster.

02:46.850 --> 02:49.020
Neither could land a telling blow.

02:51.020 --> 02:52.270
How boring!

02:52.690 --> 02:53.940
Laomoto-SAN?

02:53.940 --> 02:56.230
It's almost time for your live broadcast.

02:56.230 --> 02:57.680
NRRRR!

02:57.680 --> 03:00.860
Finish that rat off quickly!

03:01.110 --> 03:04.370
But show him pain and despair first!

03:08.200 --> 03:11.000
What's wrong, NINJA Slayer-SAN?

03:11.000 --> 03:13.710
You won't use the power of your own NINJA SOUL?

03:14.210 --> 03:17.000
There's no SENSEI to save you now.

03:17.000 --> 03:17.840
I need them not!

03:17.840 --> 03:20.880
I shall defeat you with only my own KARATE and CHADŌ.

03:20.880 --> 03:23.390
This battle is between you and me.

03:23.390 --> 03:27.770
Throwing the enemy off guard with provocations
and ZEN questions is a common NINJA technique!

03:27.770 --> 03:30.480
Why won't you draw your weapon?

03:30.480 --> 03:33.520
I can feel a small NINJA SOUL within it.

03:33.860 --> 03:35.820
It's the one you used on that night, is it not?

03:35.820 --> 03:39.690
BEPPIN's power is not necessary for dealing with the likes of you!

03:40.150 --> 03:40.570
YEEART!

03:40.990 --> 03:41.990
GWARGH!

03:54.330 --> 03:55.170
SATSUBATSU!

03:55.170 --> 03:56.500
Don't underestimate me!

03:56.500 --> 03:56.920
YEEART!

03:58.000 --> 03:59.050
GWARGH!

04:02.130 --> 04:03.890
You're getting desperate.

04:05.470 --> 04:08.140
He must be running at an incredible speed,

04:08.140 --> 04:09.890
but it's as if he was in a dream.

04:09.890 --> 04:12.810
His own movements, along with his surroundings, seem so slow!

04:12.810 --> 04:15.350
His NEURONS have accelerated!

04:12.810 --> 04:15.350
NOTE: This is only possible within a NINJA NERVOUS SYSTEM.

04:17.230 --> 04:18.520
YEEART!

04:23.360 --> 04:24.660
BEPPIN...

04:26.570 --> 04:27.910
WASSHOI!

04:27.910 --> 04:30.160
KIRISUTE GOMEN!

04:30.160 --> 04:31.160
Do not hesitate!

04:41.340 --> 04:43.170
GWAAAAAAAAARGH!

04:43.630 --> 04:46.140
BEPPIN was unable to end him?

04:46.390 --> 04:49.640
But I must finish things with this man!

04:50.010 --> 04:54.100
Dark NINJA-SAN, that is not what BEPPIN wants.

04:54.440 --> 04:59.110
Dark NINJA-SAN, the time has come to serve a new master.

05:00.860 --> 05:03.690
DŌMO. I am Master TORTOISE.

05:03.690 --> 05:05.530
I can see into the future.

05:05.530 --> 05:07.950
Not terribly far, though.

05:08.240 --> 05:10.910
DŌMO. I am Master CRANE.

05:08.240 --> 05:10.910
NOTE: CRANES are birds of
the group Gruiformes.

05:10.910 --> 05:12.750
I can see into the past.

05:12.750 --> 05:15.290
Not terribly far, though.

05:17.330 --> 05:19.340
<i>More SŌKAI NINJA?</i>

05:19.340 --> 05:24.340
He'd been expecting that, knowing how difficult it
would be to battle Dark NINJA while outnumbered!

05:24.340 --> 05:24.840
But...

05:24.840 --> 05:28.300
The logs of rage have been thrown into the fireplace of his soul!

05:28.800 --> 05:31.810
Fujikido Kenji's body overflowed with power!

05:31.810 --> 05:34.100
YEEART!

05:34.100 --> 05:36.140
Begone, brigand.

05:36.140 --> 05:37.400
You are not welcome here.

05:41.400 --> 05:42.820
GWARGH!

05:45.650 --> 05:47.410
Paralysis poison?!

05:54.910 --> 05:57.670
Now, let us hurry, Dark NINJA-SAN.

05:57.670 --> 06:01.170
You have learned that
Thunderforge-SAN is in KYŌTO.

06:01.170 --> 06:03.550
Why do you not act?

06:03.550 --> 06:07.340
KYŌTO is under control of the ZAIBATSU SHADOW GUILD.

06:07.340 --> 06:12.100
And I still have the mission that Laomoto-SAN gave me.

06:14.350 --> 06:18.640
A mission is nothing compared to fate.

06:17.640 --> 06:18.640
<i>Curse you...</i>

06:18.640 --> 06:22.730
You must find the three JINGI and reforge BEPPIN.

06:19.900 --> 06:21.560
<i>Curse you... </i>

06:23.110 --> 06:24.940
The three JINGI...

06:24.940 --> 06:27.860
The SWORD, JEWEL, and MIRROR.

06:28.280 --> 06:31.570
No, that is an untrue story.

06:31.570 --> 06:33.620
Then what are the true three JINGI?

06:33.620 --> 06:37.580
The MASK, NUNCHUCK, and BRACER.

06:50.840 --> 06:53.050
NINJA Slayer-SAN.

06:53.550 --> 06:56.390
Now is not yet the time.

06:57.350 --> 06:59.230
Dragon-SENSEI...

06:59.640 --> 07:04.110
I thought I was completely alone.

07:04.110 --> 07:06.070
How much I have to learn!

07:06.070 --> 07:07.820
There is no need for words.

07:08.400 --> 07:10.820
FŪRIN KAZAN CHADŌ.

07:11.280 --> 07:14.950
And... FŪRIN KAZAN...

07:26.300 --> 07:29.470
This is perfect CHADŌ breathing.

07:29.840 --> 07:32.250
KYŌTO...

07:32.250 --> 07:35.510
SHŌGUN OVERLOAD.

07:35.510 --> 07:40.100
GAION. KINKAKU. KATSU. WANSŌ...

07:40.100 --> 07:41.850
NUNJA.

07:41.850 --> 07:43.440
Dragon-SENSEI.

07:44.310 --> 07:47.530
You saved my life again.

07:48.030 --> 07:49.360
YEEART!

07:50.530 --> 07:54.530
Well? Shall you make excuses and flee once more?

07:54.530 --> 07:57.910
Our battle is not yet finished, Dark NINJA-SAN.

07:58.490 --> 08:00.540
He's still alive—

08:00.540 --> 08:03.460
Get those absurd SHISHIMAI costumes out of the way!

08:00.540 --> 08:03.460
NOTE: SHISHIMAI are DANCING NINJA LIONS.

08:03.670 --> 08:06.420
This is a battle between you and me,

08:06.420 --> 08:08.670
which began that night on the SUGOI Tall Building!

08:09.380 --> 08:11.170
I will kill him!

08:12.550 --> 08:14.140
You're wasting time.

08:14.140 --> 08:19.600
Even worse, your hands will be tainted by the blood on one so impure.

08:19.930 --> 08:22.140
And your hands are very important...

08:22.140 --> 08:23.640
I won't let you escape!

08:23.640 --> 08:25.310
YEEART!

08:26.270 --> 08:29.690
BUDDHA! What manner of JITSU is this?

08:36.410 --> 08:37.580
Fuyuko!

08:37.910 --> 08:39.080
Tochinoki!

08:51.300 --> 08:53.510
In the not-too-distant future,

08:54.090 --> 08:57.140
I will face Dark NINJA again.

08:57.140 --> 09:00.850
But first, I must defeat Laomoto Khan.

09:01.560 --> 09:03.020
And save Nancy-SAN.

09:09.730 --> 09:11.690
Someone is calling me.

09:12.320 --> 09:13.440
YEEART!

09:15.320 --> 09:16.950
I was right!

09:20.530 --> 09:21.660
YEEART!

09:31.590 --> 09:32.920
Nancy-SAN!

09:32.920 --> 09:34.340
You're safe?

09:34.340 --> 09:35.880
Safe?

09:35.880 --> 09:37.640
Yes, I'm fine.

09:37.640 --> 09:39.680
My NEURONS are safe.

09:39.680 --> 09:43.810
I'm sorry. This happened because I screwed up.

09:47.850 --> 09:49.020
Thank you.

09:53.070 --> 09:54.070
I'm okay.

09:54.070 --> 09:55.690
I've got some organic SUSHI.

09:59.030 --> 10:03.330
The CHADŌ ASSASSIN FIST consumes many calories.

10:03.330 --> 10:09.540
The explosive increase in metabolic speed requires high-quality energy replenishment.

10:38.650 --> 10:40.070
Who are you?

10:40.320 --> 10:43.950
You've got guts, coming into my room like this.

10:44.200 --> 10:45.740
I'll call Fujio!

10:49.290 --> 10:50.000
Let us go.

10:52.130 --> 10:54.630
That's right. That's just right.

10:54.630 --> 10:56.840
But I'll make you KEJIME later.

10:54.630 --> 10:56.840
NOTE: KEJIME is NINJA LINE-DRAWING torture.

10:56.840 --> 10:57.840
Hey, wait!

10:57.840 --> 11:00.260
That's mine! Leave it here!

11:00.260 --> 11:01.430
I'll call Fujio!

11:01.720 --> 11:03.800
Hey, wait! Hey!

11:06.640 --> 11:07.890
Who was that child?

11:07.890 --> 11:12.730
Laomoto's son. One of many, to be precise.

11:12.730 --> 11:13.860
I see.

11:14.570 --> 11:16.610
Can you escape on your own?

11:16.610 --> 11:18.940
There's a cyber-control room nearby.

11:18.940 --> 11:21.530
If you can escort me there, I'll be fine.

11:21.530 --> 11:25.280
Instead of slowing you down, I can help you.

11:25.280 --> 11:28.330
I can hack a way open to the top floor.

11:28.330 --> 11:29.910
Then we'll call it even.

11:32.540 --> 11:33.830
All that's left...

11:33.830 --> 11:38.210
If I hacked that, it would make things pretty interesting, wouldn't it?

11:41.380 --> 11:44.090
All the evil deeds the SŌKAI SYNDICATE has ever done

11:44.090 --> 11:48.350
are backed up inside my Cerebral Memory Area.
